.TH COF-MCP 1 "2026-11-13" "cof 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
cof-mcp \- Run the circuitry MCP server (stdio transport)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
cof mcp [OPTIONS]
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs the Circuitry MCP server on the stdio transport, for an MCP client to
launch as a subprocess.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
The command failed, or the input was invalid.
.TP
.B 2
A usage error -- an unrecognized option or missing argument.
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBcof(1)\fR, \fBcof-run(1)\fR
